===RATIONALE===
PreferGuardOverIf splits a clause and propagates the guard condition variable name as the positional parameter name, producing inconsistent names across clauses (triggers InconsistentParamNames which has no fix). The fix must rename the new clause's parameter to match the original's name and update all references in that clause body.
